假莱欧斯。","summary_i18n":{"cn":"你们分工明确地开始制作终极料理混沌虚空之黑暗召唤锅，差最后一步时，另外一个莱欧斯飞过来阻止。看来你们得先分辨真假莱欧斯。","en":"With all ingredients gathered, you begin preparing the ultimate dish: the Summoner's Stew. Just as you're about to finish, another Laios appears out of nowhere and tries to stop you. You'll have to figure out which one is real.","jp":"手分けして「混沌と虚空の暗黒召喚鍋」を作っていたが、いよいよ仕上げというその時――空からもう一人のライオスが現れた。果たしてどちらが本物だろうか？","kr":"우리는 역할을 나누어 혼돈 이계의 어둠 소환 스튜를 만들기 시작했다. 마지막 한 스푼을 남겨둔 순간, 또 다른 라이오스가 날아와 우리를 막았다. 우선 진짜 라이오스부터 찾아야 할 것 같다."},"summary_status":{"cn":"hash_not_found","en":"matched_luae","jp":"matched_luae","kr":"matched_luae"},"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640100","asset_path":"mn/gameplay_story/NodeCanvas__DialogueTree__mn__gameplay_story_10640100.decoded.json","graph":"stories/mn/gameplay_story/10640100.graph.json","locales":{"cn":"locales/cn/mn/gameplay_story/10640100.json","en":"locales/en/mn/gameplay_story/10640100.json","jp":"locales/jp/mn/gameplay_story/10640100.json","kr":"locales/kr/mn/gameplay_story/10640100.json"},"machine_locales":{},"stats":{"source_node_count":54,"graph_node_count":44,"effect_event_count":3,"text_entry_count":44,"speaker_entry_count":11,"cast_state_line_count":34,"path_dependent_cast_state_count":0,"cinematic_count":0,"picture_count":2,"subtitle_count":0,"cinematic_dialogue_count":0},"dialogue_statement_ids":["1064010001","1064010002","1064010003","1064010004","1064010005","1064010006","1064010007","1064010008","1064010009","1064010010","1064010011","1064010011","1064010001","1064010012","1064010013","1064010014","1064010015","1064010016","1064010017","1064010017","1064010002","1064010018","1064010019","1064010020","1064010021","1064010021","1064010003","1064010022","1064010023","1064010024","1064010025","1064010026","1064010027","1064010028","1064010028","1064010004","1064010029","1064010030","1064010031","1064010032","1064010033","1064010034"],"cinematic_statement_ids":[],"previous_plot_asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640090","next_plot_asset_